2026-10-31T00:00:01Z (RFD66606-2379) 'where the desktop zips ship, and what the page and the Space carry.
 # tags: rfd:scope, rfd:no-final-newline
 Text:RFD2379  1 LINE
 Text:Written

2026-10-31T00:00:02Z (RFD66606-2379) 'The desktop zips ship as release assets, so the Space stays under its limit.
 # tags: rfd:hook
 Text:RFD2379  1 LINE
 Text:Written

2026-10-31T00:00:03Z (RFD66606-2379) 'A Space holds at most 1 GB, and the upload of three zips of 69, 84 and 91 MB was refused at the limit. Every earlier upload of the zips still counted in its history.
 # tags: rfd:intrigue
 Text:RFD2379  1 LINE
 Text:Written

2026-10-31T00:00:04Z (RFD66606-2379) 'Upload the next zip as an asset of the guest's GitHub release, not to the Space, and let the game Space link to it.
 # tags: rfd:exit
 Text:RFD2379  1 LINE
 Text:Written

