2026-10-31T00:00:12Z (RFD66606-2379) 'The Space limit
 # tags: rfd:details-heading
 Text:RFD2379  1 LINE
 Text:Written

2026-10-31T00:00:13Z (RFD66606-2379) 'The upload of three zips of 69, 84 and 91 MB was refused at the limit. The Space history was squashed to one commit to free it, and the upload script now deletes any zip from the Space.
 # tags: rfd:details
 Text:RFD2379  1 LINE
 Text:Written

2026-10-31T00:00:14Z (RFD66606-2379) 'The page and the preview
 # tags: rfd:details-heading
 Text:RFD2379  1 LINE
 Text:Written

2026-10-31T00:00:15Z (RFD66606-2379) 'The page shows the downloads on its first slide and the web game on its last slide, as a preview (operator, 2026-10-17). The preview starts its download only when that slide opens.
 # tags: rfd:details
 Text:RFD2379  1 LINE
 Text:Written

2026-10-31T00:00:16Z (RFD66606-2379) 'A change to the game script
 # tags: rfd:details-heading
 Text:RFD2379  1 LINE
 Text:Written

2026-10-31T00:00:17Z (RFD66606-2379) 'A change to the game script alone leaves the guest and every translation hash as they were, so only the `.pck` of each zip is replaced. Each new zip started translated and printed `RESULT PASS` on its own system on 2026-10-17. The web game's slowest frame in the first round read 139 to 145 ms before and after the change.
 # tags: rfd:details
 Text:RFD2379  1 LINE
 Text:Written

